.TH MENU_RENDER 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
menu_render \- Draw the items top to bottom from m\->x, m\->y, indenting and recoloring the selected one
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqmenu.h\(dq
.BI "void menu_render(const Menu *m);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Draw the items top to bottom from m\->x, m\->y, indenting and recoloring the selected one. Call from the owning scene's render.
.SH MODULE
menu (src/engine/menu/menu.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR menu_handle_input (3),
.BR gge (1),
.BR gge\-scenes (7)
